{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20772","headline":"冬行三首 三 · 卢仝","name":"冬行三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不敢唾汴水，汴水入东海。\n汚泥龙王宫，恐获不敬罪。\n不敢蹋汴堤，汴堤连秦宫。\n蹋尽天子土，馈餫无由通。\n此言虽太阔，且是臣心肠。\n野风结阴兵，千里鸣刀枪。\n海月护羇魄，到晓点孤光。\n上不事天子，下不识侯王。\n夜半睡独觉，爽气盈心堂。\n颜子甚年少，孔圣同行藏。\n我年过颜子，敢道不自强。\n船人虽奴兵，亦有意智长。\n问我何所得，乐色填清扬。\n我报果有爲，孔经在衣裳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20772.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20772","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}